<title>Netherlands: VIB 1996 DIRECT RESULT DFL 134 MILLION.</title>
<headline>VIB 1996 DIRECT RESULT DFL 134 MILLION.</headline>
<dateline>ZEIST, Netherlands 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>Net investment result (net profit)  134.0  vs 131.4</p>
<p>    ditto per share (guilders)		3.47 vs   3.45</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)			 3.45 vs   3.40</p>
<p>NOTE - Property investment fund VIB NV said in November it</p>
<p>expected the 1996 net investment per share to be about unchanged</p>
<p>from the previous year's level.</p>
</text>
